    {
      "version": "v1.8.19",
      "name": "v1.8.19 - Extracted MKV Subtitles Fix",
      "published_at": "2026-07-16T13:44:06Z",
      "body": "## 🐛 Bug Fix: Extracted MKV Subtitles Classification\n\nFixed extracted MKV subtitles being incorrectly classified as orphaned subtitles, which prevented them from displaying episode numbers.\n\n### What was broken\n- When subtitles were extracted from MKV files, they were sometimes treated as orphaned instead of paired with the source video\n- Orphaned subtitles display differently in UI (without episode info from the paired video)\n- This was a race condition in subtitle pairing detection\n\n### What's fixed\n- Extracted subtitles now explicitly check `pairedWithMkv` flag to prevent orphan classification\n- Subtitles extracted from MKV are now correctly recognized as paired, not orphaned\n- Episode information now displays correctly for extracted subtitles\n\n### Files changed\n- SubtitleUploader.jsx: Added `pairedWithMkv` flag check in orphaned subtitle filter",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/opensubtitles/OpenSubtitles-Uploader-PRO/releases/tag/v1.8.19",
      "prerelease": false,
