      "body": "## 🐛 Bug Fix: Episode Display\n\nFixed episode numbers not displaying in video details when using the Features API data source.\n\n### What was broken\n- Episodes (Season/Episode numbers) were only visible when using XML-RPC data\n- When REST API (Features) data loaded, episode information disappeared from UI\n- Backend was correctly detecting episodes, but UI wasn't showing them\n\n### What's fixed\n- Added season/episode display to Features API rendering path\n- Episodes now consistently appear for all data sources\n- VideoFile component now merges episode data from GuessIt with Features API data\n\n### Files changed\n- VideoFile.jsx: Added season/episode fields to Features API details section",
